OL,3,GNEWSAFire service to trial tweaks to
OL,4,Aentry requirements
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire service has said it will trial
OL,7,Fchanges to hiring firefighters,
OL,8,Fincluding lowering the minimum
OL,9,Fqualifications, in a bid to remove
OL,10,F"unnecessary barriers".
OL,12,FCambridgeshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,13,Fsaid its previous entry requirement of
OL,14,Ffive GCSEs, including Maths and
OL,15,FEnglish, would be replaced with a Level
OL,16,F2 qualification (equivalent to two
OL,17,FGCSEs) for its next application window
OL,18,Fin early 2027.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
