OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFire service to trial tweaks to
OL,4,Aentry requirements
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe change followed from feedback it
OL,7,Fhad received from focus groups in
OL,8,FPeterborough last year, including
OL,9,Findividuals from different community
OL,10,Fgroups and ages.
OL,12,FA fire service spokesperson said it
OL,13,Fwanted to ensure the criteria and entry
OL,14,Ftests "do not cause unnecessary
OL,15,Fbarriers for attracting a diverse
OL,16,Fworkforce".
